WEBVTT

00:07:27.663 --> 00:07:31.288
So ask them, "How's it going?
Are you delivering value?

00:07:31.329 --> 00:07:34.413
Are you able to collaborate well?
How's your work-life balance?

00:07:34.454 --> 00:07:36.204
What do you love? What do you hate?"

00:07:36.246 --> 00:07:38.913
And take those learning
and spread them around.

00:07:39.746 --> 00:07:42.121
This is new for all of us.

00:07:42.163 --> 00:07:43.704
We're not going to get it right

00:07:43.746 --> 00:07:46.621
the first, second,
third or even fourth time.

00:07:46.663 --> 00:07:51.121
But together with conversation
and data, and experiments,

00:07:51.163 --> 00:07:54.121
we're going to learn our way
to a better future of work.

00:07:54.163 --> 00:07:55.413
So that's number two.

00:07:55.454 --> 00:07:57.038
Number one, trust your people.

00:07:57.079 --> 00:07:58.996
Number two, be data-driven.

00:07:59.038 --> 00:08:00.746
Here's number three.